WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.752 --> 00:00:03.504
If you have a garden
and a library,

00:00:03.587 --> 00:00:04.838
you have everything you need.

00:00:04.922 --> 00:00:07.466 line:0%
I don't know if it was always
there from the beginning,

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:09.218 line:0%
this sort of attraction

00:00:09.301 --> 00:00:10.344
with one another.

00:00:15.641 --> 00:00:16.517
Do you?

00:00:17.226 --> 00:00:18.268
Do I what?

00:00:18.769 --> 00:00:19.686
Have all you need?

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:21.730
Almost.

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:25.067
Thrown in the circumstances,
I think that it evolves,

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.193
the relationship.

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:35.827
-This is BSL.
-Yeah.

00:00:35.911 --> 00:00:37.037
I use ASL.

00:00:37.621 --> 00:00:38.539
They're different.

00:00:39.206 --> 00:00:41.416 line:0%
A couple of our actors
had to learn ASL

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.584
during the course
of the season,

00:00:42.668 --> 00:00:44.920
or at least enough
to communicate with Sean.

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:51.260
One motivating factors
that I came here

00:00:51.343 --> 00:00:53.262
is to sort of try to learn
and grow,

00:00:53.345 --> 00:00:54.763
and it's been amazing.

00:00:55.222 --> 00:00:58.225
I wanted to be able
to talk to you in your language.

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:02.312
Sean and Jack,
they were great.

00:01:02.396 --> 00:01:03.772
You have to
watch them and see.

00:01:03.855 --> 00:01:04.982
They did an amazing job.

00:01:14.449 --> 00:01:16.285
Can you teach me
one more phrase

00:01:16.368 --> 00:01:17.661
in sign language?

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:20.122
How do you say "kiss me"?

